{title: Hes Been Faithful}
{key: Ab}
{x_theme: faith-trust, grace-mercy, prayer}
{x_source: chrd:hes_been_faithful.chrd}

{comment: Intro}
[Gb]     [Eb]     [Ab]

{comment: Verse 1}
[Ab]In my moments [Fm7]of   fear
Through every [Cm7]pain, every [Ab]tear
There's [Dbm7]a    God   [Bbmaj7]who's   been [Eb7]faithful [Abmaj7]to      me
When [Ab]my   [Abmaj7]strength was all [Fm7]gone
When my [Cm7]heart had [Ab]no song
[Dbmaj7]Still    in love He's [Bbm7]proved faithful [C]to   [C7]me

{comment: Refrain}
Every [Ab]word He's [Ab7]promised is [Dbmaj7]true
What [C7]I     [Fm7]thought was [Bb7]impossible, [Bbm7]I've seen my God [Eb7]do

{comment: Chorus}
He's [Eb]been [Ab]faithful, [Ebm7]faithful [Ab7]to    [Dbmaj7]me[Bbm7]
Looking [Cm7]back, His love [Fm7]and mercy I [Ebm7]see[Ab7]
Though [Dbmaj7]in    my    heart, I [Gm7]have questioned, [C7]even  [Fm7]failed to [F7]believe
Yet He's [Bb7]been faithful, [Eb7]faithful to [Dbmaj7]me

{comment: Instrumental}
[Cm-Cm7-FM7-Bbm7-Eb]

{comment: Verse 2}
When [Abmaj7]my     heart looked [Fm7]away so [Cm7]many times, I [Ab7]could not pray
[Dbmaj7]Still in love, [Bbmaj7]He   was   [Eb7]faithful [Abmaj7]to       [Db]me
Oh [Eb]the days I [Abmaj7]spent so [Fm7]selfishly, reaching [Cm7]out for what [Ab]pleased me
Even [Dbmaj7]then,    [Bbm7]God was faithful to [C]me[C7]
Every [Ab]time I'd [Ab7]come back to [Dbmaj7]Him
[C]He is [Fm7]waiting with [Bb7]open arms [Bbm7]and I see once a[Eb7]gain
